Index: Templates

Purpose:
  Reusable project structure templates. These templates are consumed by
  the project-structure skill to generate concrete project/ directories
  from human prompts. Templates are NOT project-specific — they are
  generic scaffolding instantiated per project.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd (this file)
   2  @_sdd/docs/00-about/project.template.md
   3  @_sdd/docs/20-architecture/overview.template.md
   4  @_sdd/decisions/DEC-000.template.sdd
   5  @_sdd/tasks/TASK-000.template.sdd
   6  @_sdd/stack/LAYER.template.sdd
   7  @_sdd/modules/module.template.sdd
   8  @_sdd/modules/api.template.sdd
