   10 @_sdd/modules/cases.template.sdd
   11 @_sdd/modules/flow.template.sdd
   12 @_sdd/architecture/system.template.md

Rules:
  [T1] Templates are READ-ONLY — they MUST NOT be modified per project.
  [T2] Placeholders use {ANGLE_BRACKET} format.
  [T3] Unsubstituted placeholders MUST be replaced with null or empty.
  [T4] Templates MUST be consumed by the project-structure skill, not copied manually.
  [T5] Template content is generic — no project-specific data here.

